hifiberry-vu-meter (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * PipeWire audio level capture with binary WebSocket streaming
  * Supports stereo L/R RMS, peak, and clipping detection
  * Lightweight 6-byte binary protocol at 10Hz update rate
  * REST version endpoint at /api/v1/version
  * Nginx reverse proxy configuration for WebSocket support

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Thu, 27 Feb 2026 20:00:00 +0000
